{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/01/1949469/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月になりましたね。\n今年もあと一ヶ月だあ！\n最寄り駅にもイルミネーションで\nきらきらしてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日ソファーで横になってたら\nいつのまにか寝てて\n起きたら朝になってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/01/1949469/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/01/1949469/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/01/1949469/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式写真変わってた！\n新制服だ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型で写真って変わるなあ～...\nやっぱり耳かけたほうがいいかな。\n......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美雲のメンバー紹介で\n私の番がきましたーーうわーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/01/1949469/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいなあ。\n書いてくれてありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼美雲ひげ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/01/1949469/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4th個人pvの話。\nテーマが苦手なものらしい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私がまだ撮影してないとき、\n先に撮影したメンバーに\n「どうだった⁈」\nって聞いても何も\n教えてくれなかったんだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が苦手なもの...\nきっとみなさんわからないと思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/01/1949469/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか、\n「...え？！」\nってなりそうだな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに、だね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/01/1949469/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではがっつりテスト勉強します！\nがんばる～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}